I am a little slow at this, but it finally. --  after forty-odd years -- da=
wns on me that the fact that apparently ad hoc rules work for accounting fo=
r the movement between logic and language is the reason for Montague gramma=
r, which has wonderfully rational rules which merely happen to have surpris=
ing results, whereas the present system jumps directly from one surprising =
result to another.

